# Pill statusline

The footer `title` is rendered as-is, so a deck can hand it a fully formatted
pill — Nerd Font powerline caps wrapping an ANSI-colored label — straight from
the frontmatter. Look at the bottom-left corner.

---

## Flexible titles

The renderer never builds the pill; the `title` string itself carries the Nerd
Font glyphs and ANSI color. `current/total` rides the bottom-right, and there
is no rule line above the footer.
